---
description: Cloud Agent UI changes must be demoed on localhost with a recording
alwaysApply: true
---

When running as a Cursor Cloud Agent and the task changes user-facing UI:

1. Use the prepared environment. Do not reinvent install. The app is `bun run dev` at http://127.0.0.1:3000.
2. Demo localhost only. Do not open Vercel preview URLs (SSO / Deployment Protection).
3. After the change, wait until localhost is serving, then RecordScreen the result and take a screenshot.
4. Attach those artifacts to this run so the user can see them without checking out the branch.
5. A pull request without a recording or screenshot is incomplete.
